What that licence covers
------------------------

Everything in this repository. There is no carve-out any more, because the
files that needed one are no longer here.

Until 2026-10-09 this repository also carried five documents belonging to two
other companies — a counterparty's agreement text reproduced verbatim, and a
client's brief, product-design note and unit-economics model — kept as written
records of how the product came to be specified. They were never ours to
license, `NOTICE` said so, and that fixed the licensing claim while answering
nothing about whether they could be published at all. They have been withdrawn
from this repository pending advice, and `pnpm check:stewardship` fails if any
of them returns. Their history has not yet been cleaned; that is
`docs/OPEN_ITEMS.md` §8.

No third-party source code is vendored into this tree. Dependencies are
resolved by pnpm from pnpm-lock.yaml and keep their own licences; nothing
under node_modules is redistributed from here. The fonts the interface uses
are loaded from Google Fonts at runtime and no font file is in this
repository.


