The hosted service
------------------

This repository is the software. The service at yuha.studio is a separate,
commercially operated deployment of it, and the obligations that attach to
selling to consumers attach to its operator rather than to this project.

That operator is a sole proprietor, and the five fields of the statutory
disclosure — a person's legal name, home address, telephone number and email —
are supplied by the deployment's secret store and appear in no file here, and
in no commit: they were in three tracked values files until 2026-10-08, and the
history that carried them was rewritten. See `docs/OPEN_ITEMS.md` §8 and
GOVERNANCE.md.
